# kex: check-only
# `using FS` brings in FS's names, among them its nested module `Path`. The
# members of `Path` are reached through it (`Path.separator`), not bare:
# a bare `separator` checked clean and ran on BEAM while the walker refused it.
using FS

main do
  IO.printLine(Path.separator)
  IO.printLine(separator)
end
